    <a class="status" href="../../methods/dft-sigma/index.html">DFT+Σ implementation note</a>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No SIESTA source patch needed</strong> — the shift applies through TBtrans's built-in
      δH term (<code>TBT.dH</code>) once we provide the correctly constructed
      <code>deltaH.dH.nc</code> file.</li>
